abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): a browser-only teaching demo of Gouji, a six-player four-deck team shedding game from Shandong: alternating seats form two teams and a "gouji" combination can only be answered by the player sitting opposite. The JavaScript engine reproduces the Python engine move-by-move; AIs are rule-based and a side panel explains each greedy decision.
